  "title": "Permian Resources Announces Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Earnings Conference Call",
  "summary": "MIDLAND, Texas – Permian Resources Corporation (“Permian Resources” or the “Company”) (NYSE: PR) announced today that it will report fourth quarter and full year 2025 financial and operating results after the market closes for trading on Wednesday, February 25, 2026. Management will host an earnings conference call on Thursday, February 26, 2026, at 9:00 a.m. […]",
